<title>USA: Kaydon buys Hein-Werner unit assets.</title>
<headline>Kaydon buys Hein-Werner unit assets.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kaydon Corp said Friday it had completed the purhcase of the assets of Great Bend Industries from Hein-Werner Corp for $22.5 million cash.</p>
<p>Kaydon said Kansas-based Great Bend will become part of Kaydon's fluid power division.</p>
<p>Kaydon is a manufacturer of such products as anti-friction bearings, bearing systems and components, filters and filter housings, retaining rings, hydraulic cylinders and fluid control devices.</p>
